      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#14212d;color:#ecf5f1;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;padding:4.6cqw 5cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column'><div style='font:700 1.5cqw/1 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#e9b96d'>TWILITE · RELEASE NOTES WORKFLOW</div><div style='font:650 5cqw/1.1 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:2cqw'>Release notes,<br/>from commit to public.</div><div style='max-width:70cqw;font:400 2.1cqw/1.55 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#c3d5d4;margin-top:2cqw'>A repeatable path from reviewed changes to a published release, with explicit stop conditions and the owner’s decision at each gate.</div><div style='flex:1;min-height:0'></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.4cqw'><div style='min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;background:#1b3d48;border:.2cqw solid #3c7c76;border-radius:1.8cqw;padding:2cqw 2.2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#e9b96d'>03</div><div style='font:650 2.4cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin-top:1cqw'>Approved</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.3 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:.6cqw;color:#c3d5d4'>Owner picks the entries</div></div><div style='min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;background:#1b3d48;border:.2cqw solid #3c7c76;border-radius:1.8cqw;padding:2cqw 2.2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#e9b96d'>05</div><div style='font:650 2.4cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin-top:1cqw'>Verified</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.3 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:.6cqw;color:#c3d5d4'>Prove it is live</div></div><div style='min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;background:#1b3d48;border:.2cqw solid #3c7c76;border-radius:1.8cqw;padding:2cqw 2.2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#e9b96d'>06</div><div style='font:650 2.4cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin-top:1cqw'>Owner-gated</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.3 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:.6cqw;color:#c3d5d4'>Never auto-publish</div></div></div><div style='font:600 1.5cqw/1.3 system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#e9b96d;margin-top:2.4cqw'>Nine stages · Three owner decisions · Public writes are create-only</div></div>"
        },
