        "title": "03 · Owner approves entries",
        "gateType": "owner-approval",
        "requirement": "The owner reads each candidate and sets its status in the queue: approved, deferred or excluded. Only approved entries go into the draft. A candidate’s wording is checked for review or deployment sentences that must not be published.",
        "evidence": "Each entry’s status in the queue\nThe owner’s own edits kept\nNo review wording inside a summary",
        "decision": "pending",
        "authority": "owner-approval-required",
        "onFailure": "Stop. Entries that are not approved stay in the queue.",
